[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341701979","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110957#issuecomment-3341701979","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110957","id":3341701979,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HLlNb","user":{"login":"jcostello","id":1168582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjg1ODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1168582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello","html_url":"https://github.com/jcostello","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T13:11:39Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T13:11:39Z","body":"Is a good idea to have this per scene instead of auto accept always?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341701979/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341864525","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110957#issuecomment-3341864525","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110957","id":3341864525,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HMM5N","user":{"login":"Wayne-Kim","id":75321423,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzIxNDIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75321423?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim","html_url":"https://github.com/Wayne-Kim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayne-Kim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T15:34:54Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T15:34:54Z","body":"@jcostello, that's a good question. Currently, 'interface/editor/auto_apply_external_scene_changes' has been added as an editor setting and is intended to be applied globally. This level of implementation seems appropriate because only users who desire this feature can activate it in the settings window.\r\n\r\nThe primary purpose of this feature is to prevent pop-ups from interrupting the workflow when generating scenes via AI, thereby maximizing efficiency. Workflow efficiency is a critical aspect of AI-driven content creation, and designing a workflow that sequentially connects various AI functions to achieve desired outcomes is key. By automatically reloading externally modified scenes and project settings, we can minimize interruptions in the AI generation process without manual confirmation.\r\n\r\nOf course, I understand that having scene-specific settings could provide more granular control in certain situations. This could be considered a good suggestion for future improvements. However, our initial focus was on implementing a global auto-apply option to enhance the consistency and productivity of the AI generation workflow.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341864525/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341908265","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110957#issuecomment-3341908265","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110957","id":3341908265,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HMXkp","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T16:38:58Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T16:38:58Z","body":"Thanks for opening a pull request :slightly_smiling_face: \r\n\r\nFeature pull requests should be associated to a *feature proposal* to justify the need for implementing the feature in Godot core. Please open a proposal on the [Godot proposals](https://github.com/